            "block_content": "2. After an employee has worked eight (8) hours at straight time in the workday, the employee shall be paid time and one-half (1-1/2) his or her pay rate for all additional hours worked in the same workday. For the purposes of this Section E.2., time paid for but not worked shall not be counted in computing straight time hours.",
